        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Dark Hollow Flash.</em> A cero so black it takes the light with it.</p><p>Make a spell attack roll against one creature within 90 feet. On a hit it takes @Damage[3d6[spirit]] damage, doubled on a critical hit.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><strong>Refined (9th)</strong> On a critical hit the target is <strong>off-guard</strong> until the start of your next turn, and Cero Oscuras gains a <strong>5-foot burst</strong> at the target's location dealing half damage to other creatures in it (basic Reflex).</p><hr /><p><em>A spell attack roll rather than a save is what buys the higher die count.</em></p>"
